      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-15/valterra-platinum-bets-on-underground-mining-project-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3278c5d2dc835e1c74db5b54</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:30:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>South Africa's Valterra Platinum is the world's largest miner of platinum group metals by market cap, and Valterra's Mogalakwena facility is the world's largest open-pit platinum mine. The company plans to take its operations in a new direction, tunneling down for higher-grade underground ore with a project called Sandsloot. On Bloomberg Chief Future Officer, Valterra Platinum CFO Sayurie Naidoo tells Jennifer Zabasajja why the underground extension is a perfect fit with the company's "value over volume" strategy. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
